  1: //! Acceptance tests for the M3 core contracts, against the real design evidence in
  2: //! `.collab/c3-design/`. The headline test is byte-identity: parse a real store into the
  3: //! typed model and re-serialize; the bytes must match what the plugin wrote.
  4: 
  5: use std::fs;
  6: use std::path::PathBuf;
  7: 
  8: use c3_core::findings::FindingsFile;
